{"author":194,"label":"Ananya Goswami","poems":[{"id":182,"source_language":"en","variants":{"en":{"label":"English","title":"Ashes","kind":"Original","stanzas":[["I hear the thousand waves","crashing on the sand","all night","windswept leaves","incessant susurration","iridescent dreams of the earth","swept and buried into","the heart of darkness","I see the skeletons of poor souls","laying on the sand","weeping,","sighing","wallowing","in the darkness"],["I see the pain","Feel the wound...","the storm","the burning ember in your heart"],["I know what it means","to be in pain","I know what it means","to die a thousand deaths","and wake up to the same world","over and over and over again..."],["I see your heart","the endless emptiness","I feel","the warmth of your tear","I hear","your raw words","wrapped and then unwrapped","in rhythmic art of poesy"],["I see ashes of broken dreams","floating","in the air","falling down","on the surface of","the ocean deep and dark"],["I see your deer eyes","quest for the ashes","quest for a new life","to reborn like the mythical bird"],["but the ashes won`t always","make you Phoneix","sometimes it`ll be the old you","the broken you","who will have to","curve the path through hell..","to keep on living."]],"inline_breaks":[],"hidden_lines":[]},"hi":{"label":"हिन्दी","title":"राख","kind":"Translation","stanzas":[["मैं हज़ार लहरें सुनती हूँ","रेत से टकराती हुईं","सारी रात","हवा में बिखरे पत्ते","निरंतर सरसराहट","धरती के इंद्रधनुषी सपने","बहाकर दफ़नाए गए","अँधेरे के हृदय में","मैं बेचारी आत्माओं के कंकाल देखती हूँ","रेत पर पड़े","रोते,","आह भरते,","लोटते","अँधेरे में"],["मैं पीड़ा देखती हूँ","घाव महसूस करती हूँ...","तूफ़ान","तुम्हारे हृदय का जलता अंगारा"],["मैं जानती हूँ क्या अर्थ है","पीड़ा में होने का","मैं जानती हूँ क्या अर्थ है","हज़ार मौतें मरने का","और उसी दुनिया में जागने का","बार-बार, बार-बार, बार-बार..."],["मैं तुम्हारा हृदय देखती हूँ","अंतहीन ख़ालीपन","महसूस करती हूँ","तुम्हारे आँसू की गरमी","सुनती हूँ","तुम्हारे कच्चे शब्द","